{"id":"steam-975630","steam":975630,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Fossil Diggers VR","summary":"Explore, solve puzzles, uncover fossils, build dinosaurs, and watch them come alive before your eyes.","about":"In an alternate world, giant fossils are being unearthed across the globe. You’re recruited by renegade scientist Dr Peggy Noon to help prove her outlandish theory that “dinosaurs” once existed.\r\n\r\nTravel to uncharted locations, dig up fossils and piece them together to prove that dinosaurs once roamed the earth. Your search takes a dangerous turn when you uncover the mysterious Particle 58, and when Peggy goes missing it is up to you to reveal the truth behind the lie: that these magnificent creatures hold the key to understanding our past—and a warning for our future.\r\n\r\n\nExplore Environments\n\r\nClimb, rappel, chop vines, break-apart rocks, and solve puzzles to find fossils.\r\n\r\n\nUncover Fossils\n\r\nUse your pickaxe to break open digsites, then throw your drop bin to teleport fossils back to your tent.\r\n\r\n\nBuild Dinosaurs\n\r\nLike a three-dimensional jigsaw puzzle, piece the dinosaur together and watch it come alive before your eyes.\r\n\r\n\nBring Dinosaurs To Life\n\r\nPlace the final fossil and watch dinosaurs come alive in front of your eyes.\r\n\r\n\nWatch the Environment Change\n\r\nWatch the environment move from chaos to serenity as you complete the dinosaur.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/library_600x900.jpg?t=1692946126","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/header.jpg?t=1692946126","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/library_hero.jpg?t=1692946126","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/header.jpg?t=1692946126","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=169